cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article below."
title: "Cuscuta LCM RNA-seq: tissue-specific transcriptomics of the Cuscuta campestris–tomato haustorial interface"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
abstract: >-
  R Markdown notebooks and normalized count tables for laser capture
  microdissection RNA-seq of Cuscuta campestris haustoria and tomato host stem
  tissue at early, intermediate and mature haustorial stages: filtering, edgeR
  TMM normalization, MDS, PCA and self-organizing maps. Verified to run with
  R 4.5.3 in November 2026.
